<title>MALAYSIA: CRICKET-BANGLADESH BEATS SCOTLAND IN ICC SEMI-FINAL.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-BANGLADESH BEATS SCOTLAND IN ICC SEMI-FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangladesh beat Scotland by 72 runs in a rain-affected second semi-final of the International Cricket Council (ICC) trophy after play resumed on Wednesday.</p>
<p>SCORES:</p>
<p>Bangladesh 243/7 in 50 overs (Tuesday); Scotland 171 all out in 44.5 overs (Greg Williamson 39 not out, Iain Philip 37, George Salmond 24; Mohammed Rafique 4 for 25 in 5.5 overs, Enamul Hoque Moni 3 for 31 off 10 overs.</p>
</text>
